@startuml
title LessenHub AI Architectuur (met Privacy, lokaal vs extern)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

legend left
  <|--  Extension (specialisatie)
  <|..  Implementation (interface realisatie)
  *--   Composition (onderdeel kan niet zonder geheel)
  o--   Aggregation (onderdeel kan zelfstandig bestaan)
  -->   Dependency (sterke afhankelijkheid)
  ..>   Zwakke dependency
endlegend

package "Frontend (Browser)" {
  class FEUpload as "Upload Page" <<frontend>>
  class FEForm as "Lesson Form" <<frontend>>
  FEUpload --> FEForm : vult velden
}

package "Lokaal: LessenHub Backend API" {
  class LesAnalyseController <<local>>
  interface IAiService <<local>>
  class FallbackAiService <<local>>
  class DocumentExtractorService <<local>>
  class LesTemplateExtractorService <<local>>
  class PrivacyRedactionService <<privacy>>
  class ExceptionHandlingMiddleware <<local>>
  class AuthMiddlewareOIDC <<privacy>>
  class Serilog <<privacy>>
  class MongoDB <<local>>

  class RedactionRules <<privacy>>
  PrivacyRedactionService *-- RedactionRules : redactie-regels

  IAiService <|.. FallbackAiService
  LesAnalyseController --> DocumentExtractorService : 1. extract raw text
  LesAnalyseController --> PrivacyRedactionService : 2. redact PII (FIRST!)
  LesAnalyseController --> LesTemplateExtractorService : 3. parsing redacted text
  LesAnalyseController --> IAiService : 4. AI on redacted text

  FallbackAiService o-- IAiService : provider-keten
  LesAnalyseController --> Serilog : audit/logging
  LesAnalyseController --> MongoDB : opslag lesdata
  ExceptionHandlingMiddleware --> LesAnalyseController
  AuthMiddlewareOIDC --> LesAnalyseController
}

package "Lokaal: AI Services" {
  class AnthropicService <<local>>
  class OpenAiService <<local>>
  class GeminiService <<local>>

  IAiService <|.. AnthropicService
  IAiService <|.. OpenAiService
  IAiService <|.. GeminiService

  FallbackAiService ..> AnthropicService : try provider 1
  FallbackAiService ..> OpenAiService : try provider 2
  FallbackAiService ..> GeminiService : try provider 3
}

package "Extern: Cloud Services" {
  class AnthropicApi <<external>>
  class OpenAIApi <<external>>
  class GeminiApi <<external>>
  class SurfConextOIDC <<external>>
}

AnthropicService ..> AnthropicApi : HTTPS (redacted text)
OpenAiService ..> OpenAIApi : HTTPS (redacted text)
GeminiService ..> GeminiApi : HTTPS (redacted text)

AuthMiddlewareOIDC ..> SurfConextOIDC : login/claims

FEUpload --> LesAnalyseController : POST /LesAnalyse/analyseer (multipart)
FEUpload --> AuthMiddlewareOIDC : session/cookies

note right of DocumentExtractorService
  Stage 1: Raw document → Plain text locally.
  ⚠ Inhoud bevat nog PII/gevoelig data.
  (Onmiddellijk geredacteerd in stap 2)
end note

note right of PrivacyRedactionService
  PRIVACY-FIRST FLOW (stap 2):
  - Email: voornaam@domain.nl -> [EMAIL]
  - Telefoon: 06-12345678 -> [PHONE]
  - IBAN: NL91AB1234567890 -> [IBAN]
  - BSN: 123456789 -> [BSN]
  - Postcode: 1234 AB -> [POSTCODE]
  - PII-velden (Naam, Docent, etc) -> [REDACTED]
  
  Alle volgende stappen (parsing + AI) 
  werken op geredacteerde tekst!
end note

note bottom of LesAnalyseController
  Privacy-First Pipeline:
  1. Extract raw text from file
  2. Redact all PII IMMEDIATELY
  3. Template extract from redacted text
  4. AI analyse on redacted text
  5. Merge both results
  → MongoDB stores: redacted content only
  → External AI always sees: redacted content
end note

@enduml
